{"1974":{"jc":[{"t":"Sea bathing on Somvati Amas","p":"England (coast)","w":[]}]},"2000":{"pl":["San Jose"],"w":["During an evening public assembly the balaks performed an impressive dance. A drama, 'Aaj Sudhaare Aavtikaal', lucidly and effectively portrayed the problems facing families today.","The Mayor of Milipitas, Mr. Henry Manayan, praised Swamishri's work in elevating youths. He honored Swamishri by presenting a plaque.","Swamishri blessed the assembly with solutions to family discord. He said, \"Today science has advanced immensely. It has given momentum but no direction. Science has provided electricity, yet darkness prevails. The need to illumine our lives has not be fulfilled. There is darkness within. The darkness of failing to understand our family, society, country and culture. To remove that darkness we need to associate with our scriptures and a God realized sadhu.\""],"ph":[["sorg-news-usa-photo-sanjose-sj","sj-2-f.jpg","Mayor of San Jose Ron Gonzalen offering a bouqet to Swamishri on September 16, 2000","sites/swaminarayan.org/news/usa/photo/sanjose/sj/sj-2-f.jpg"]]},"2004":{"pl":["Gaborone"],"o":"Botswana","w":["At 6.00 pm Swamishri flew from Lenasia to Gaborone, and went from the airport to the evening satsang assembly in the mandir."]},"2007":{"ph":[["sorg-news-usa-2007-09-losangeles-baldin","15.jpg","","sites/swaminarayan.org/news/usa/2007/09/losangeles/photo/baldin/15.jpg"],["sorg-news-usa-2007-09-losangeles-baldin01","17.jpg","","sites/swaminarayan.org/news/usa/2007/09/losangeles/photo/baldin/17.jpg"],["sorg-news-usa-2007-09-losangeles-baldin01","18.jpg","","sites/swaminarayan.org/news/usa/2007/09/losangeles/photo/baldin/18.jpg"],["sorg-news-usa-2007-09-losangeles-baldin01","19.jpg","","sites/swaminarayan.org/news/usa/2007/09/losangeles/photo/baldin/19.jpg"],["sorg-news-usa-2007-09-losangeles-baldin01","21.jpg","","sites/swaminarayan.org/news/usa/2007/09/losangeles/photo/baldin/21.jpg"],["sorg-news-usa-2007-09-losangeles-baldin01","23.jpg",""